Natural Earth
-------------
First-order administrative subdivision boundaries and their ISO 3166-2 codes come
from Natural Earth (ne_10m_admin_1_states_provinces).

    https://www.naturalearthdata.com/

Natural Earth is in the public domain. No permission is needed to use it, and
crediting the authors is requested but not required.
